  "final_answer": "The Downtown Emergency Service Center (DESC Seattle) is a homeless shelter located at 515 3rd Ave S, Seattle, WA 98104. The coordinates for the shelter are 47.60220599249109,-122.33136101734422. You can contact them at (206) 464-1570 or email them at info@desc.org. For more information, visit their website at http://www.desc.org/. They are also active on social media platforms such as Twitter (https://www.twitter.com/DESCSeattle/), Facebook (https://www.facebook.com/pages/Downtown-Emergency-Service-Center/220323835957), and Instagram (https://www.instagram.com/descseattle). DESC provides services for men aged 60+ or any adult who is vulnerable due to mental illness, developmental disabilities, chemical dependency, and/or medical condition. They also offer shelter for women, with assignments made at 10am. Additional slots are assigned as space allows. DESC is a non-profit organization dedicated to helping marginalized individuals find homes."
